@startuml 005-guided-notes-export-sequence
title 005 guided-notes-export：時序圖

actor "老師" as T
participant "web\nteacherDownload" as W
participant "app.py" as App
participant "Activity" as Act
participant "results" as R
participant "guided_notes" as GN

T -> W : 按「匯出 Guided Notes」
W -> App : GET /api/teacher/export（X-Teacher-Key）
App -> Act : phase == ended？已匯入？
alt 非 ended 或未匯入
  App --> W : 409
end
App -> R : winning_answers(activity)
R --> App : {題號: 得主各子題答案}（經 ScoringRule）
App -> GN : write_answers(source_bytes, notes, answers)
loop 每題有得主者、每個子題
  GN -> GN : fill(slot, answer)：佔位符取代或「標籤＋答案」
  GN -> GN : 寫入 (sheet, cell)、data_type = "s"
end
GN --> App : 新 xlsx 位元組（原檔不變）
App --> W : 200 xlsx、Content-Disposition filename*=UTF-8''…
W --> T : 瀏覽器儲存檔案
@enduml
